# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Customer payroll working files. NEVER COMMIT THESE — this repository is
# PUBLIC (github.com/biztinct/gitlocal, visibility=public).
#
# On 2026-09-12 the RIZE/ folder held a bank upload template and a payroll
# setup pack carrying a customer's EMPLOYEE BANK ACCOUNT NUMBERS — 61 and 68
# populated number cells, beside payee names and bank codes. They were
# untracked and one `git add -A` away from being published. A password can be
# rotated in a minute; a bank account cannot.
#
# These are working documents, not product. No code reads them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
RIZE/**/*.xlsx
RIZE/**/*.xls
RIZE/**/*.xlsm
RIZE/**/*.csv
RIZE/**/*.pdf
RIZE/**/*.docx
RIZE/**/*.doc

# Excel/Word lock files, anywhere.
~$*
